ults to return each unique investor_id and investor_name combination, fulfilling the entity-list requirement without explicit aggregation since no measures are specified. The inner join policy ensures only investors meeting all three conditions are returned."", ""generate_sql_parse_error"": """", ""generate_sql_raw_response_preview"": "" ```json\n{\n  \""sql\"": \""SELECT ip.investor_id, ip.investor_name\\nFROM ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTOR_PROFILE_001 ip\\nINNER JOIN ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HEALTH_001 ph ON ip.investor_id = ph.investor_id\\nINNER JOIN ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001 h ON ip.investor_id = h.investor_id\\nWHERE ip.risk_tolerance = 'Conservative'\\n  AND ph.risk_score > 75\\n  AND h.investment_type = 'Equity'\\nGROUP BY ip.investor_id, ip.investor_name\"",\n  \""reasoning\"": \""The query identifies Conservative investors by filtering ATOM_ENTIT"", ""pre_scan_validation_is_valid"": true, ""pre_scan_validation_reason"": ""Valid"", ""scan_status"": ""success"", ""scan_row_count"": 62, ""scan_error"": """", ""scan_error_type"": """", ""scan_raw_rows"": ""[{\""investor_id\"": \""INV-021\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Arvind Chauhan\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-047\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Aishwarya Reddy\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-069\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Sunita Patel\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1025\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Rohan Arora\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1045\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Arvind Nair\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1072\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Amrita Kulkarni\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1090\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Rajesh Yadav\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1093\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Akshay Yadav\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1120\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Arjun Bhat\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1139\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Rahul Chauhan\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1154\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Ishita Hegde\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1176\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Vikra