nvestor_id, investor_name\n  FROM ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTOR_PROFILE_001\n  WHERE risk_tolerance = 'Conservative'\n)\n-- Final query intersecting all three conditions\nSELECT \n  cp.investor_id,\n  cp.investor_name\nFROM conservative_profiles cp\nINNER JOIN portfolio_health_high_risk ph ON cp.investor_id = ph.investor_id\nINNER JOIN etf_holdings eh ON cp.investor_id = eh.investor_id\nGROUP BY cp.investor_id, cp.investor_name"", ""generate_sql_reasoning"": ""Pre-aggregate holdings (ETF positions) and portfolio health (risk_score > 75) at investor_id level using CTEs to avoid fanout. Inner join these pre-aggregated sets with the base investor profile table filtered for Conservative risk_tolerance. Group by investor_id to return distinct investors who satisfy all three criteria."", ""generate_sql_parse_error"": """", ""generate_sql_raw_response_preview"": "" {\n  \""sql\"": \""WITH \\n-- Pre-aggregate holdings to identify investors with ETF positions\\netf_holdings AS (\\n  SELECT investor_id\\n  FROM ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001\\n  WHERE investment_type = 'ETF'\\n  GROUP BY investor_id\\n),\\n-- Pre-aggregate portfolio health for risk_score > 75 threshold\\nportfolio_health_high_risk AS (\\n  SELECT investor_id\\n  FROM ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HEALTH_001\\n  WHERE risk_score > 75\\n  GROUP BY investor_id\\n),\\n-- Base table: conservative investors with profiles\\nc"", ""pre_scan_validation_is_valid"": true, ""pre_scan_validation_reason"": ""Valid"", ""scan_status"": ""success"", ""scan_row_count"": 53, ""scan_error"": """", ""scan_error_type"": """", ""scan_raw_rows"": ""[{\""investor_id\"": \""INV-034\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Sneha Reddy\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-047\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Aishwarya Reddy\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1045\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Arvind Nair\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1061\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Vikram Verma\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1072\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Amrita Kulkarni\""}, {\""investor