, ""group_by"": [], ""filters"": [{""source_class"": ""ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTOR_PROFILE_001"", ""field"": ""risk_tolerance"", ""operator"": ""="", ""value"": ""Moderate"", ""value_type"": ""string""}, {""source_class"": ""ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HEALTH_001"", ""field"": ""risk_score"", ""operator"": "">"", ""value"": 75, ""value_type"": ""number""}, {""source_class"": ""ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001"", ""field"": ""investment_type"", ""operator"": ""="", ""value"": ""Corporate Bond"", ""value_type"": ""string""}], ""measures"": [], ""ranking"": {""required"": false, ""metric"": null, ""direction"": null, ""limit"": null}, ""required_classes"": [""ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTOR_PROFILE_001"", ""ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HEALTH_001"", ""ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001""], ""execution_strategy"": ""single_sql"", ""output_schema"": [""investor_id"", ""investor_name""], ""requirements"": [{""text"": ""Moderate investors"", ""implemented_by"": [""filters.0""]}, {""text"": ""risk score above 75"", ""implemented_by"": [""filters.1""]}, {""text"": ""hold a Corporate Bond"", ""implemented_by"": [""filters.2""]}, {""text"": ""Which investors"", ""implemented_by"": [""grain.final_group_by.0"", ""output_schema.0"", ""output_schema.1""]}], ""unresolved_requirements"": [], ""reason"": ""The query selects investors who meet three conditions: moderate risk tolerance (filter on ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTOR_PROFILE_001.risk_tolerance), risk score above 75 (filter on ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HEALTH_001.risk_score), and holding at least one Corporate Bond (filter on ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001.investment_type). Inner joins ensure all conditions must be met. The result is grouped by investor_id to return distinct investors, with output schema providing investor identification fields."", ""structural_repairs"": [], ""contract_errors"": [], ""contract_warnings"": [], ""domain_context_trace"": {""fingerprint"": ""17431387871b488d8ce132ac8b0fe19f6f5a82b41806145ebcec8814c193f17e"", ""available_rules"": []}}, ""generated_sql"": ""SELECT \n  p.investor_id,\n  p.investor_name\nFROM ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTOR_PROFILE_001 AS p\nINNER JOIN ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HEALTH_001 AS h \n  ON p.investor_id = h.investor_id\nINNER JOIN ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001 AS ph \n  ON p.investor_id = ph.investor_id\nWHERE p.risk_tolerance = 'Moderate'\n  AND h.risk_score > 75\n  AND ph.investment_type = 'Corporate Bond'\nGROUP BY p.investor_id, p.investor_name"", ""generate_sql_reasoning"": ""The query identifies investors meeting three intersecting conditions by inner joining three tables: investor profile (Moderate risk tolerance), portfolio health (risk score > 75), and portfolio holdings (Corporate Bond). The inner join policy ensures only investors present in all three tables are considered. GROUP BY on investor_id with investor_name ensures distinct investors are returned, as an investor may have multiple health records or bond holdings. The output schema projects the requested identification fields."", ""generate_sql_parse_error"": """", ""generate_sql_raw_response_preview"": "" ```json\n{\n  \""sql\"": \""SELECT \\n  p.investor_id,\\n  p.investor_name\\nFROM ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTOR_PROFILE_001 AS p\\nINNER JOIN ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HEALTH_001 AS h \\n  ON p.investor_id = h.investor_id\\nINNER JOIN ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001 AS ph \\n  ON p.investor_id = ph.investor_id\\nWHERE p.risk_tolerance = 'Moderate'\\n  AND h.risk_score > 75\\n  AND ph.investment_type = 'Corporate Bond'\\nGROUP BY p.investor_id, p.investor_name\"",\n  \""reasoning\"": \""The query identifies investors meeting three in"", ""pre_scan_validation_is_valid"": true, ""pre_scan_validation_reason"": ""Valid"", ""scan_status"": ""success"", ""scan_row_count"": 47, ""scan_error"": """", ""scan_error_type"": """", ""scan_raw_rows"": ""[{\""investor_id\"": \""INV-018\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Meena Rao\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-041\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Sneha Nair\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-058\"", \""inv