ablation-generic-reliability-v6,wealth_management_125_question_benchmark:WM125-3T-021,Which Aggressive investors have a liquidity score below 50 and a sector allocation above 0% in Consumer Goods?,"[{""investor_id"": ""INV-033"", ""investor_name"": ""Aishwarya Sharma""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-1004"", ""investor_name"": ""Abhishek Hegde""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-1016"", ""investor_name"": ""Ankita Joshi""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-1229"", ""investor_name"": ""Ramesh Joshi""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-1247"", ""investor_name"": ""Ramesh Verma""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-282"", ""investor_name"": ""Anita Deshmukh""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-375"", ""investor_name"": ""Akshay Kulkarni""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-482"", ""investor_name"": ""Deepak Mishra""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-559"", ""investor_name"": ""Sneha Joshi""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-611"", ""investor_name"": ""Amit Verma""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-764"", ""investor_name"": ""Deepak Rao""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-798"", ""investor_name"": ""Aishwarya Singh""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-888"", ""investor_name"": ""Anjali Hegde""}]",Hard,Health + allocation profile,Multi-Relational,wealth_management_125_question_benchmark.csv,"[{""investor_id"": ""INV-033"", ""investor_name"": ""Aishwarya Sharma""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-1004"", ""investor_name"": ""Abhishek Hegde""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-1016"", ""investor_name"": ""Ankita Joshi""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-1229"", ""investor_name"": ""Ramesh Joshi""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-1247"", ""investor_name"": ""Ramesh Verma""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-282"", ""investor_name"": ""Anita Deshmukh""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-375"", ""investor_name"": ""Akshay Kulkarni""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-482"", ""investor_name"": ""Deepak Mishra""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-559"", ""investor_name"": ""Sneha Joshi""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-611"", ""investor_name"": ""Amit Verma""}, {""investor_id"": ""INV-764"", ""investor_name"": ""Deepak Rao""}, {""investor_id"": ""IN