HEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS UNDERFUNDED_SUM\\n    FROM ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTMENT_GOAL_001\\n    GROUP BY INVESTOR_ID\\n)\\nSELECT p.INVESTOR_ID,\\n       p.INVESTOR_NAME\\nFROM ATOM_ENTI"", ""pre_scan_validation_is_valid"": true, ""pre_scan_validation_reason"": ""Valid. The SQL correctly implements all requirements: filters for Aggressive risk_tolerance and diversification_score < 25, validates existence of Bear Market scenarios and underfunded goals via HAVING clauses on pre-aggregated CTEs, and returns the required output schema. The preserve_null_groups flag in the spec contradicts the explicit existence requirements (>0), but the query correctly prioritizes the logical requirements over this metadata flag. Column name case differences are acceptable in SQLite."", ""scan_status"": ""success"", ""scan_row_count"": 11, ""scan_error"": """", ""scan_error_type"": """", ""scan_raw_rows"": ""[{\""investor_id\"": \""INV-030\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Ramesh Rao\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-068\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Vikram Yadav\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-133\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Rohan Arora\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1485\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Geeta Rao\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-182\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Bhavna Verma\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-386\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Siddharth Iyer\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-482\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Deepak Mishra\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-485\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Vivek Pandey\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-645\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Kavita Mishra\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-653\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Suresh Bhat\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-892\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Anita Nair\""}]"", ""self_heal_attempts"": 1, ""failure_stage"": """", ""validation_is_valid"": true, ""validation_reason"": ""Result rows satisfy the Query_Spec output shape checks."", ""bound_inputs"": {}, ""attempts"": [{""stage"": ""Generate_SQL"", ""attempt"": 1, ""output_pr