ario"", ""operator"": ""="", ""value"": ""Economic Growth"", ""value_type"": ""string""}], ""measures"": [{""output_name"": ""has_underfunded_goal"", ""source_class"": ""ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTMENT_GOAL_001"", ""field"": ""goal_id"", ""formula"": ""CASE WHEN current_value < target_amount THEN 1 ELSE 0 END"", ""formula_fields"": [""current_value"", ""target_amount""], ""formula_stage"": ""row"", ""population_filters"": [], ""aggregate_filters"": [{""field"": ""has_underfunded_goal"", ""operator"": ""="", ""value"": 1, ""stage"": ""entity"", ""scope"": ""population""}], ""missing_entity_value"": null, ""unit"": null, ""per_entity_operation"": ""MAX"", ""final_operation"": null, ""requires_distinct"": false, ""operand_kind"": ""physical""}], ""ranking"": {""required"": false, ""metric"": null, ""direction"": null, ""limit"": null}, ""required_classes"": [""ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTOR_PROFILE_001"", ""ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HEALTH_001"", ""ATOM_EVENT_SCENARIO_REBALANCING_001"", ""ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTMENT_GOAL_001""], ""execution_strategy"": ""preaggregate_sql"", ""output_schema"": [""investor_id"", ""investor_name""], ""requirements"": [{""text"": ""Conservative investors"", ""implemented_by"": [""filters.0""]}, {""text"": ""diversification score below 25"", ""implemented_by"": [""filters.1""]}, {""text"": ""Economic Growth scenario record"", ""implemented_by"": [""filters.2""]}, {""text"": ""at least one underfunded goal"", ""implemented_by"": [""measures.0""]}], ""unresolved_requirements"": [], ""reason"": ""The query filters investors based on four required conditions. Inner joins ensure all conditions must be met. The 'at least one underfunded goal' condition is implemented using a MAX aggregation on a row-level CASE expression that identifies underfunded goals (current_value < target_amount), with an aggregate filter requiring the result to be 1. Preaggregate_sql strategy is chosen to properly handle one-to-many relationships with scenario_rebalancing and investment_goals tables by grouping before final join to avoid fanout and ensure correct entity-level evaluation."", ""structural_repairs"": [{""path"": ""measures.0.operand_kind"", ""from"": null, ""to"": ""physical"", ""evidence"": ""operand names resolve against the declared source or planned aliases""}], ""contract_errors"": [], ""contract_warnings"": [], ""domain_context_trace"": {""fingerprint"": ""17431387871b488d8ce132ac8b0fe19f6f5a82b41806145ebcec8814c193f17e"", ""available_rules"": []}}, ""generated_sql"": ""WITH \n  investors AS (\n    SELECT investor_id, investor_name\n    FROM ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTOR_PROFILE_001\n    WHERE risk_tolerance = 'Conservative'\n  ),\n  portfolio_health AS (\n    SELECT investor_id\n    FROM ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HEALTH_001\n    WHERE diversification_score < 25\n    GROUP BY investor_id\n  ),\n  scenario_rebalancing AS (\n    SELECT investor_id\n    FROM ATOM_EVENT_SCENARIO_REBALANCING_001\n    WHERE scenario = 'Economic Growth'\n    GROUP BY investor_id\n  ),\n  underfunded_goals AS (\n    SELECT \n      investor_id,\n      MAX(CASE WHEN current_value < target_amount THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as has_underfunded_goal\n    FROM ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTMENT_GOAL_001\n    GROUP BY investor_id\n    HAVING has_underfunded_goal = 1\n  )\nSELECT \n  i.investor_id,\n  i.investor_name\nFROM investors i\nINNER JOIN portfolio_health ph ON i.investor_id = ph.investor_id\nINNER JOIN scenario_rebalancing sr ON i.investor_id = sr.investor_id\nINNER JOIN underfunded_goals ug ON i.investor_id = ug.investor_id;"", ""generate_sql_reasoning"": ""Uses pre-aggregate CTEs for each one-to-many relationship to avoid fanout: (1) filters Conservative investors, (2) pre-filters portfolio health records with diversification_score < 25, (3) pre-filters Economic Growth scenario records, and (4) computes MAX of row-level underfunded flag per investor (current_value < target_amount) and filters for investors with at least one underfunded goal. Inner joins enforce all four conditions must be met, returning investor_id and investor_name from the base entity table."", ""generate_sql_parse_error"": """", ""generate_sql_raw_response_preview"": "" {\n  \""sql\"": \""WITH \\n  investors AS (\\n    SELECT investor_id, investor_name\\n    FROM ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTOR_PROFILE_001\\n    WHERE risk_tolerance = 'Conservative'\\n  ),\\n  portfolio_health AS (\\n    SELECT investor_id\\n    FROM ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HEALTH_001\\n    WHERE diversification_score < 25\\n    GROUP BY investor_id\\n  ),\\n  scenario_rebalancing AS (\\n    SELECT investor_id\\n    FROM ATOM_EVENT_SCENARIO_REBALANCING_001\\n    WHERE scenario = 'Economic Growth'\\n    GROUP BY investor_id\\n  ),"", ""pre_scan_validation_is_valid"": true, ""pre_scan_validation_reason"": ""Valid"", ""scan_status"": ""success"", ""scan_row_count"": 11, ""scan_error"": """", ""scan_error_type"": """", ""scan_raw_rows"": ""[{\""investor_id\"": \""INV-028\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Chetan Yadav\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1082\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Suresh Verma\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1289\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Anjali Verma\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1292\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Deepak Bhat\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-1354\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Dipti Verma\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-146\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Dipti Chauhan\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-302\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Ankita Sharma\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-382\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Arvind Reddy\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-548\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Ishita Yadav\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-706\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Vikram Deshmukh\""}, {\""investor_id\"": \""INV-707\"", \""investor_name\"": \""Siddharth Bhat\""}]"", ""self_heal_attempts"": 0, ""failure_stage"": """", ""validation_is_valid"": true, ""validation_reason"": ""Result rows satisfy the Query_Spec output shape checks."", ""bound_inputs"": {}, ""attempts"": [{""stage"": ""Generate_SQL"", ""attempt"": 1, ""output_