estors that satisfy five distinct conditions across five tables. Using inner joins ensures only investors meeting all criteria are returned. The underfunded goal condition (current_value < target_amount) is implemented as a derived measure that flags underfunded goals, with an aggregate filter ensuring only investors with at least one underfunded goal are included. Pre-aggregate SQL strategy is used to handle the multi-table join and aggregation efficiently."", ""structural_repairs"": [{""path"": ""plan.base_entity"", ""from"": ""investor"", ""to"": ""ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTOR_PROFILE_001"", ""evidence"": ""unique explicit owner of projected or distinctly counted entity key""}, {""path"": ""measures.0.operand_kind"", ""from"": null, ""to"": ""physical"", ""evidence"": ""operand names resolve against the declared source or planned aliases""}], ""preserve_null_groups"": true, ""contract_errors"": [], ""contract_warnings"": [""group_by.0 has no quoted requirement."", ""group_by.1 has no quoted requirement.""], ""domain_context_trace"": {""fingerprint"": ""17431387871b488d8ce132ac8b0fe19f6f5a82b41806145ebcec8814c193f17e"", ""available_rules"": []}}","SELECT i.investor_id, i.investor_name
FROM ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTOR_PROFILE_001 i
INNER JOIN ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HEALTH_001 h ON i.investor_id = h.investor_id
INNER JOIN ATOM_ENTITY_PORTFOLIO_HOLDING_001 ha ON i.investor_id = ha.investor_id
INNER JOIN ATOM_EVENT_REBALANCING_ACTION_001 r ON i.investor_id = r.investor_id
INNER JOIN ATOM_ENTITY_INVESTMENT_GOAL_001 g ON i.investor_id = g.investor_id
WHERE i.risk_tolerance = 'Conservative'
  AND h.risk_score > 50
  AND ha.investment_type = 'Gold'
  AND r.action = 'Defensive Shift'
